#
# Counter-example for math:MultiparameterFiltrationShape (derived from the min-1
# qualified restrictions on math:MultiparameterFiltration's math:filtrationIndexPoset
# and math:hasFiltrationStage): a math:MultiparameterFiltration naming neither its
# index poset nor a single filtration stage. Validation MUST emit
# shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent (math:IncompleteMultiparameterFiltration).
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:bareFiltration a math:MultiparameterFiltration .
